  "description": "I saved the world disguised as my brother, died a hero, and woke up flat broke. My plan for job security? Become a maid at a manor so toxic that workers don't last a week. You can’t get fired if no one wants the job! Too bad my new workplace features a mysterious viscount, a shady gardener, and daily assassination attempts. I used to slaughter entire armies, now I’m just trying to clock out alive. Can I get some damn peace, or did I just sign up to be a part of the empire's deadliest conspiracy? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
